'''Horsea''' (Japanese: '''タッツー''' ''Tattu'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

