==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dragon Majesty|Horsea|15}} from the {{TCG|Dragon Majesty}} expansion.
*'''Hook''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon|Magnemite|61}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Horsea}}.

